{% comment %}
  D2C Clinical Actives Science & FAQ
  Theme: Minimalist / The Derma Co Clinical Actives
{% endcomment %}

<section class="d2c-clin-faq" id="d2c-cfaq-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="d2c-cfaq-container">
    <div class="d2c-csec-header">
      <span class="d2c-c-badge">[LAB INQUIRIES]</span>
      <h2 class="d2c-c-title">{{ section.settings.title | default: "ACTIVE LAYERING & DERMA ANSWERS" }}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="d2c-cfaq-list">
      <details class="d2c-cfaq-item" open>
        <summary class="d2c-cfaq-q">
          <span>Can Niacinamide and Salicylic Acid be layered together?</span>
          <span class="d2c-cfaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-cfaq-a">
          Yes. Apply the 2% Salicylic Acid serum first on clean, dry skin to penetrate into the pores. Wait 1-2 minutes for absorption, followed by the 10% Niacinamide serum to soothe inflammation and regulate sebum.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-cfaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-cfaq-q">
          <span>Is skin purging normal when starting Salicylic or Retinol?</span>
          <span class="d2c-cfaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-cfaq-a">
          Mild cellular turnover purging can occur during the first 2-3 weeks as micro-comedones are brought to the surface. It subsides quickly, revealing clearer and smoother underlying skin.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-cfaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-cfaq-q">
          <span>Are your products safe during pregnancy or breastfeeding?</span>
          <span class="d2c-cfaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-cfaq-a">
          Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, and Ceramides are completely pregnancy-safe. We recommend consulting your obstetrician before using high-strength Retinoids or Salicylic Acid concentrations.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="d2c-cfaq-item">
        <summary class="d2c-cfaq-q">
          <span>Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available with zero fees?</span>
          <span class="d2c-cfaq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="d2c-cfaq-a">
          Yes. Free Cash on Delivery is available across all 24,000+ Indian pincodes without any extra handling fees. Pay via Cash or UPI at your doorstep.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #d2c-cfaq-{{ section.id }} {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 70px 32px;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  .d2c-cfaq-container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .d2c-cfaq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .d2c-cfaq-item {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .d2c-cfaq-q {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .d2c-cfaq-q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .d2c-cfaq-icon { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0284c7; font-family: monospace; }
  details[open] .d2c-cfaq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); display: inline-block; }
  .d2c-cfaq-a {
    padding: 0 24px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Clinical FAQ",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "ACTIVE LAYERING & DERMA ANSWERS"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Clinical FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
